# Mint session

Production is https://www.shilltech.xyz. Do not run the engine locally. One Telegram bot and one Upstash Redis are shared by every Vercel isolate.

## Idle

No mint means paused, no snapshot timer, Pump off, and no FOMO window. Production has no `CALLOUT_MINT` and no `TREASURY_PRIVATE_KEY`. The key is pasted in OPS and stored encrypted. Start only when both are saved together. A mint alone must not start. Clearing the mint wipes callouts, audits, the Telegram channel, and the pin. Also stop `scripts/watch-fomo-browser.mjs` or it keeps posting.

## Start

Admin `POST /api/admin/config` applies `treasuryPrivateKey` before `coinMint`. That wipes, arms a random 5–15 minute snapshot (`SNAPSHOT_MIN_MS` 300000, `SNAPSHOT_MAX_MS` 900000, counted from when the timer is armed), and starts Pump plus migration. Durable `coinMint` in Redis wins over `CALLOUT_MINT`. Already-bonded mints stay quiet.

## FOMO

Do not call fomoapi. Theses come from an opened fomo.family window for the live mint only:

`scripts/watch-fomo-browser.mjs` with `CALLOUT_MINT` set to that mint and `CALLOUT_INGEST_URL=https://www.shilltech.xyz/api/ingest/callout`. Visible Chrome, not headless. It must refuse to post if the live mint differs. Ingest requires `body.mint` to match the watch.

## Check

OPS countdown is on `/api/state`. Public live board is `/api/public/state`. QUALIFIED is posted when callers are in the window, before the snapshot. Empty windows do not post QUALIFIED.
